    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 11, 17 and 16 corrections"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.40.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage/1.40.0> ; owl:priorVersion <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage/1.39.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1617corr_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.40.0 (2026-11-25): Chapter 16 deck story started. Work items: replace the five lambda lines of the examples by plain def functions (new examples file 4.0.0), give the nine layout warnings a fix, lengthen short titles, rebuild, then run and read all the deck checks."""@en .

